   "widgets_values": [
    "~/.cache/boson/studios/bracket-blade-signs",
    "BRACKET & BLADE, a fictional two-person sign shop in the bayfront town of the demo's world. Sentence drafted by the agent, not the operator; reforge to replace it.",
    "Shop sign design: blade signs that hang over a shop door",
    "A blade sign is the shop's own thing made big and hung over its door: one object a passer-by knows from across the street, cut and painted by hand, with the shop's name in a few lettered words.",
    "~/.cache/boson/forge-in/sign/refs",
    "~/Boson/experiments/zoom-cut/sign-in",
    "A blade sign for HALYARD COFFEE, a fictional coffee bar in the retail strip of the demo's world. It replaces the blank rust-brown blade sign that hangs from a black steel rod under the flat black canopy at its entry (commission image 1), read from across the parkway. Fixed facts: the name HALYARD COFFEE; double-sided, about 30 x 24 inches; square to the street. What the sign is and how it is made is the studio's call. Show the design itself, square-on, on a plain ground."
   ],
